#: ../../solver-patchers.md:107
msgid ""
"`PWRBCK*` are high-cost backstop generators that absorb feasibility edge "
"cases. If their `TotalAnnualMaxCapacity` / "
"`TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment` are hardcapped at 0, the safety net is"
" removed and the LP can become infeasible. This patcher reopens those "
"caps."
msgstr "`PWRBCK*` son generadores backstop de alto costo que absorben casos límite de factibilidad. Si su `TotalAnnualMaxCapacity` / `TotalAnnualMaxCapacityInvestment` están topados en 0, se elimina la red de seguridad y el LP puede volverse infactible. Este patcher reabre esos topes."

